OL,3,ANvidia shares up nearly 33% and tech   
OL,4,Astocks rally after Jensen Huang returns
OL,6,FNvidia shares skyrocketed after the    
OL,7,Ftech firm reinstated Jensen Huang as   
OL,8,Fits chief executive with immediate     
OL,9,Feffect.                                
OL,11,FHis shock reinstatement comes less than
OL,12,Ftwo weeks after Huang resigned after   
OL,13,Fadmitting an affair with a woman who   
OL,14,Fwas alleged to be a Chinese spy, a     
OL,15,Fperiod in which shares in the chipmaker
OL,16,Fhave also fallen significantly.        
OL,18,FNvidia shares had risen by nearly 33%  
OL,19,Fby midday ET (17:00 GMT), boosting its 
OL,20,Fmarket value by about $1 trillion and  
OL,21,Falso lifted stock markets, with the    
OL,22,Ftech-heavy Nasdaq up by nearly 7%.     
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
